        "delivery_shape": "same-executable source mechanism",
        "algorithm": "plain scalar fields or always-lock-free relaxed std::atomic fields plus std::lower_bound over caller-owned runtime bounds",
        "source": "clean Folly checkout pins the mature ownership/fixed-histogram lineage; the machine-profile-bound C++23 standard library is the exact lower-bound comparison authority"
      }
    }
  ],
  "strata": [
